@startuml cgms_cloud_api
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title CGMS Cloud API Interface

component "Mobile App" as App
component "API Gateway" as API
component "Ingestion Service" as Ingest
component "Analytics Engine" as Analytics
component "Diagnostics Service" as Diag
component "Device Registry" as Registry
component "Data Store" as DB
component "Clinician Portal" as Portal
component "Ops / Support Portal" as Ops

' --------------------
' Ingestion Paths
' --------------------
App --> API : POST /readings
App --> API : POST /telemetry
App --> API : POST /diagnostics

API --> Ingest : validate + normalize

' --------------------
' Persistence
' --------------------
Ingest --> DB : store readings
Ingest --> DB : store telemetry
Ingest --> DB : store diagnostics

' --------------------
' Analytics
' --------------------
Ingest --> Analytics : enqueue analysis
Analytics --> DB : trends / aggregates

' --------------------
' Diagnostics & Fleet Health
' --------------------
Ingest --> Diag : fault events
Diag --> DB : fleet health metrics

' --------------------
' Device Lifecycle
' --------------------
Ingest --> Registry : update device state
Registry --> DB : lifecycle records

' --------------------
' Read APIs
' --------------------
Portal --> API : GET /reports
API --> Portal : glucose + trends

Ops --> API : GET /fleet/health
API --> Ops : diagnostics dashboards

note bottom of API
Security:
- OAuth2 / OpenID Connect
- TLS 1.2+
- PHI encrypted at rest
- No device control endpoints
end note

note right of Analytics
Non-real-time:
- Trend analysis
- Population insights
- No safety-critical decisions
end note

note right of Diag
Operational use only:
- Fault clustering
- Device reliability
- No clinical interpretation
end note

@enduml

